 DeferredRevenue), against $2 billion a year earlier.","cites":["FSLR.deferred.2025","FSLR.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 7,900 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $661,000 for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["FSLR.q.employees","FSLR.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $2.8 billion in cash and cash equivalents and $51.8 million in short-term investments, and $499 million of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + DebtCurrent). Cash and short-term investments exceeded that debt by $2.4 billion (computed from four filed figures).","cites":["FSLR.cash.2025","FSLR.sti.2025","FSLR.debtLong.2025","FSLR.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"FSLR":{}},"quotes":{"FSLR.q.employees":{"c":"FSLR","kind":"employees","n":7900,"quote":"As of December 31, 2025, we had approximately 7,900 associates (our term for full and part-time employees), the majority of which work in the United States, Malaysia, India, and Vietnam.","source":"FSLR-0001274494-26-000021","section":"Item 1. Business","date":"2026-02-24","proof":"76e61b19770a3c24b1284cb9cb1bce15f46385f80138eea9315095f488000f1b"}}}